    <briefdescription>
<para>Container for big reference counters. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contains array of big reference counters, size of this array and number of non-zero big reference counters. When reference counter of tuple becomes more than 32767, field refs of this tuple becomes index of big reference counter in big reference counter array and field is_bigref is set true. The moment big reference becomes equal 32767 it is set to 0, refs of the tuple becomes 32767 and is_bigref becomes false. Big reference counter can be equal to 0 or be more than 32767. </para>    </detaileddescription>
